# Tiny Tales — Technical Architecture

> **Every coding agent must read this document before starting any ticket.**
> Each ticket references specific sections here. Only read the sections relevant to your ticket.

---

## 1. Stack Overview

| Layer | Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Mobile App | React Native + Expo (TypeScript) | iOS & Android |
| Navigation | Expo Router (file-based) | Screen routing |
| GraphQL Client | Apollo Client + graphql-tada | Type-safe queries |
| GraphQL API | Hasura Cloud | Auto-generated GraphQL on Postgres |
| Database | Supabase Postgres | Relational data store |
| Auth | Supabase Auth → Hasura JWT | User authentication |
| File Storage | Supabase Storage | Media uploads (photos/videos) |
| AI Pipeline | Cloudflare Workers | Transcription + narrative generation |
| State Management | Zustand | Lightweight global state |
| Styling | NativeWind (Tailwind for RN) | Utility-first styling |

