## 5. GraphQL Conventions (graphql-tada)

### Setup
- All `.graphql` files live in `apps/mobile/graphql/`
- graphql-tada generates types from the Hasura schema introspection
- Schema is introspected at `HASURA_GRAPHQL_ENDPOINT/v1/graphql`

### File naming
```
graphql/
├── queries/
│   ├── GetTalesFeed.graphql
│   └── GetTaleDetail.graphql
├── mutations/
│   ├── InsertTale.graphql
│   └── DeleteTale.graphql
└── subscriptions/
    └── OnNewComment.graphql
```

### Usage pattern
```typescript
import { graphql } from '../lib/tada'
import { useQuery } from '@apollo/client'

const GET_TALES = graphql(`
  query GetTalesFeed($familyAccountId: uuid!) {
    tales(
      where: { family_account_id: { _eq: $familyAccountId } }
      order_by: { created_at: desc }
    ) {
      id
      title
      narrative
      created_at
      author { name avatar_url }
      tale_children { child { id name photo_url } }
      tale_tags { tag }
    }
  }
`)

const { data } = useQuery(GET_TALES, {
  variables: { familyAccountId: currentUser.familyAccountId }
})
```

